(text "RMX A0.2 / LINE AUDIO / DRAFT - RCA and TS harness, 10kohm minimum external load; match the actual Rev7 Seed by calibration" (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid c5b1e74c-e7af-57f4-8d3f-597ab8205c35))
(text "Passive ADC pad includes the Seed 13.6kohm TYPICAL input impedance. No high-voltage amplifier is connected to the ADC input." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 3c9a5ddf-cdc0-50ec-a98a-fa97a241f809))
(text "SW33 is one four-pole mode switch: MASTER adds input shunts; SEND/RETURN adds output feedback shunts. Change modes in manual bypass." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 30827799-e21a-52c9-9573-aef364c95d72))
(text "K3 mute is on relay-audio; delayed K1/K2 choose dry/wet. Pop/click, stability, headroom, protection and final parts require physical validation." (at 15 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid b89c9d37-9b6f-55de-827b-73cc6ad7c861))
